  "meaning": "Only exact native thumbnail/frameless flags may be discarded when the existing native infobox image field is unwrapped. Other recognized native image options refuse the whole unwrap instead of becoming a literal caption. Non-native case variants may remain literal caption text only under the existing complete caption grammar.",
  "boundaries": [
    "Native options are case-sensitive as declared by the primary source. No lowercasing or locale guesses.",
    "Filename and namespace controls cannot turn literal source into an image.",
    "A conflicting caption, size or image alias retains all original source data.",
    "An unsupported alt/link/page/manual-thumbnail option is retained, not silently omitted."
  ],
